### Product feedback backend: sample calls (VS Code "REST Client" or IntelliJ HTTP client)
### Run them top to bottom. The login call saves the token; later calls reuse it via {{token}}.
@base = http://localhost:8081

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- LOGIN (Kabir, 106)

### 1. Ask for an OTP (always 123456 for now)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9000000106" }

### 2. Log in with phone + OTP -> token
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9000000106", "otp": "123456" }

### (the token from step 2, used by every call below)
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- SIGNUP (new number)

POST {{base}}/api/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9876500001" }

###
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9876500001", "otp": "123456", "name": "Riya", "area": "HSR Layout", "city": "Bengaluru" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- MAIN FLOW: Ghee, rate exactly 4 -> buy again

### Home screen asks for a card (note promptId)
# @name card
GET {{base}}/api/feedback-prompts/next
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One-tap rating
# @name rating
POST {{base}}/api/feedback-prompts/{{card.response.body.prompt.promptId}}/rating
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 4 }

### Buy again for a picked date
POST {{base}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "GHEE", "quantity": 1, "feedbackId": {{rating.response.body.feedbackId}} }

###
GET {{base}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- LOW RATING (log in as Asha 9000000101 first)
### Low rating: replace promptId / feedbackId with values from your own responses
POST {{base}}/api/feedback-prompts/1/rating
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 2 }

###
PUT {{base}}/api/feedback/1/issues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "issueCodes": ["SMELL", "NEAR_EXPIRY"], "note": "Smelled sour when opened" }

### No token -> 401
GET {{base}}/api/feedback-prompts/next

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- OPEN: admin / testing helpers

GET {{base}}/api/admin/customers

###
GET {{base}}/api/admin/customers/104/eligibility

###
POST {{base}}/api/admin/clock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plusDays": 2 }

###
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/clock

###
POST {{base}}/api/admin/reset-demo-data

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- OPEN: quality dashboard data

GET {{base}}/api/dashboard/summary

###
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard/summary?productId=PANEER&area=Sector 45

###
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard/feedback?maxRating=3&size=10

###
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard/filters
